Eliminated the "Download Surah" Flash & Removed the Tick Icon:
Removed the downloaded checkmark icon next to Surah rows in ExplorerScreen.
In ReaderScreen and ReaderViewModel, gated the empty-state and top-bar download actions behind isLoadingSurah, and synchronized loading completion with BundlesSnapshot + _deliveredSurahId so Room's InvalidationTracker dispatch delay never exposes an empty-state flash before Ayahs appear.
Windowed & SQL-Filtered Reader Pipeline + Composite Indices:
Added composite indices on ayahs(surahId, ayahNumber) and words(ayahId, position) via MIGRATION_3_4 and Room v4.
ReaderViewModel renders the initial Ayah window (INITIAL_AYAH_WINDOW = 24, or around targetAyah) immediately, expands to the full Surah after first visible content, skips words/word_translations queries entirely in Mushaf mode or when WBW is hidden, and filters translations in SQL (isEnabled = 1) and WBW meanings by (activeLanguage, 'en').
Deferred optional sync remains strictly after first visible render (networkCallsAtFirstVisible=0, traceFirstVisibleMs=946.86 ms vs traceOptionalSyncStartMs=1068.16 ms, mushafSkipped=true).
Compose, Font & R8/Baseline Profile Optimization:
Flattened WordByWordFlowRow cards (single Column + hoisted colors/shapes/ayah marker), split MushafPageCanvas base Tajweed AnnotatedString caching from lightweight highlight overlays so audio stepping does not re-parse Tajweed HTML, added a zero-allocation fast path to BidiUtils.sanitizeIndoPakArabic, pre-loaded only active fonts in AppContainer.warmUpAsync(), and deferred animateColorAsState in Theme.kt until the user switches themes.
Enabled isMinifyEnabled = true and isShrinkResources = true for release builds with Retrofit/Moshi/Room keep rules and expanded baseline-prof.txt.
